      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the problem is that fan_set_duty() is able to disable the fan since it call pwm_enable() internally. Whether the pwm is enabled is what is relied on in fan_get/set_enabled(). A proper fix would likely have to split the concept of pwm-enabled from fan-enabled.\n\nThe problem call-stack is something like this when thermal sets duty to 0%\nfan_set_percent_needed(pct\u003d0%)\nfan_set_rpm_target(rpm\u003d0)\nfan_set_duty(0)\npwm_set_duty(0)\npwm_set_raw_duty(0)\npwm_enable(0) \u003c- this is the same as fan_set_enabled(0)",
